---
/**
 * @category Testimonials
 * @theme starquix
 * @name Testimonials4
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 px-4 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28 xl:px-16 xl:py-32 dark:bg-stone-900'>
  <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:gap-12 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-16'>
    <img class='block aspect-[4/3] h-auto w-full rounded-2xl object-cover object-[50%_30%] md:aspect-[16/9] md:rounded-[2rem] xl:col-span-5 xl:aspect-[3/4]' src='/assets/images/content/components.webp' alt='A space glove holding up a yellow button, a label and a file icon against a blue sky' width='1024' height='1024' />
    <div class='flex flex-col gap-10 xl:col-span-7'>
      <h2 class='m-0 font-sans text-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-stone-900 text-balance md:text-6xl xl:text-[4rem] dark:text-stone-50'>Why teams stay</h2>
      <div class='flex flex-col'>
        <figure class='m-0 flex flex-col gap-5 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-6 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <blockquote class='m-0'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-900 text-pretty dark:text-stone-50'>“Our campaign pages used to wait two sprints for a developer. Now the marketing team builds them, and I review a diff instead of writing a ticket.”</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption class='flex items-center gap-3'>
            <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic08.webp' alt='Portrait of Dana Whitfield' width='40' height='40' />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Dana Whitfield</p>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Engineering lead, Pellow Health</p>
            </div>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class='m-0 flex flex-col gap-5 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-6 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <blockquote class='m-0'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-900 text-pretty dark:text-stone-50'>“We needed a booking form the editor didn’t have, so I wrote it by hand in VS&nbsp;Code. The team was designing around it on the canvas the same afternoon.”</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption class='flex items-center gap-3'>
            <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic12.webp' alt='Portrait of Sanjay Iyer' width='40' height='40' />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Sanjay Iyer</p>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Developer, Coastline Tours</p>
            </div>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class='m-0 flex flex-col gap-5 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 pt-6 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <blockquote class='m-0'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-900 text-pretty dark:text-stone-50'>“I can open a client site from two years ago and still read every file. That alone was worth the move.”</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption class='flex items-center gap-3'>
            <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic10.webp' alt='Portrait of Lea Fontaine' width='40' height='40' />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Lea Fontaine</p>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Freelance designer</p>
            </div>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
